# Heroic Feast: "When this enchantment enters, create a Food token. Whenever you gain life, choose up to that many target creatures you
# control. Put a +1/+1 counter on each of them." On turn 7, with four Grizzly Bears in play, Bot1 casts the Feast (a Food token enters)
# and then Healing Salve for 3 life: it chooses up to three creatures, a fourth target being refused, and the three take a counter
